# Everything build.ps1, test.ps1, release.ps1 and tools/fetch_python.ps1 make:
# the exes, objects and resources, the test exe, the bundled Python, the
# release build, old scan output. Run .\build.ps1 (or .\test.ps1, which
# builds first) after a clone or a pull. Untracked 2026-10-07: committed
# exes kept going stale next to the source and dirtied every build.
# build/captures/ (dumps of the game's code) is ignored too: not ours to
# publish.
build/*

# Installers (installer/wasd.iss, release.ps1)
dist/

# Personal play data and generated reports
sessions/
reports/

# Generated locally from the user's own game files (tools/extract_treasures.py); not redistributable
data/generated/
__pycache__/

# Per-user settings (spoiler tier)
settings.ini

# Per-user files in a dev checkout (AppPaths)
scratch/
logs/
